{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38570","headline":"病中宜茯苓寄李谏议 · 吴融","name":"病中宜茯苓寄李谏议","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千年茯菟带龙鳞，太华峰头得最珍。\n金鼎晓煎云漾粉，玉瓯寒贮露含津。\n南宫已借徵诗客，内署今还托谏臣。\n飞檄愈风知妙手，也须分药救漳滨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38570.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38570","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}